-# DSP-05, TRK-03: what the colours, the letters and the signs of the map mean.
%ul.map-legend
  - MapsHelper::LEGEND.each do |priority, label|
    %li
      %span.map-marker{ data: { priority: } }= priority.first.upcase unless priority == "none"
      = label
  - MapsHelper::ARRIVALS.each do |arrival, label|
    %li
      %span.map-marker{ data: { priority: "none", arrival: } }
      = label
  %li
    %span.car-marker{ data: { status: "available" } } P-12
    Car position
  %li
    %span.map-marker{ data: { priority: "critical", kind: "sos" } } SOS · P-12
    Place of a crew's SOS
